OL,5,G2100 The Forsytes
OL,6,     FThe secrets of the Forsyte family
OL,7,     Fare laid bare for a whole new
OL,8,     Fgeneration in this bold
OL,9,     Freimagining of John Galsworthy's
OL,10,     Ficonic tale.
OL,11,G2210 Coronation Street
OL,12,     FGlenda's stinging criticism gives
OL,13,     FTodd a taste for revenge, Tim
OL,14,     Fattempts to soothe a jumpy Lucy,
OL,15,     Fand Nina holds out little hope
OL,16,     Fafter an underwhelming job
OL,17,     Finterview.
OL,18,G2240 Emmerdale
OL,19,     FJimmy sells his haulage business.
OL,20,     FNicola is delighted. Jimmy agrees
OL,21,     Fto a vow renewal.
